Subject: [PATCH 96/97] POC-26: out of the buster rut - wild Pokemon punish
 back-row camping with phase strikes, packs grow with your level lead, counter
 hits fill a quarter of the gauge; binding moves pull, Mean Look draws in,
 throws, heavy hits knock back, recoil bounces; Rock Tomb lands in a plus
 (middle pins); teammates' chips join chains (TAG); codes unlock as you go (6
 + 2 per Gym Leader / rival) and lean toward your folder's; one new hand a
 battle (R); knock-back slide direction fixed; Focus Energy / Charge no longer
 borrow move-flag bits

